# somisana-ops/.env.example
#
# Copy to .env and `chmod 600 .env`. Never commit .env — it is gitignored (D19).
# Credentials live here, on the host, not in GitHub secrets: the whole premise of this
# redesign is that a hand-run script and the GitHub Actions runner behave identically,
# and that breaks the moment credentials only exist as GitHub secrets.
#
# Neither host needs everything below — see deploy/runbook.md.

# --- mims3 -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# The gh PAT is NOT read from here — `gh auth login` stores it in
# ~/.config/gh/hosts.yml (see deploy/runbook.md §1; already done on this host).
#
# D23 bring-up roots: uncomment during parallel-run testing, delete at cutover.
# These are the ONLY overrides my_env.sh needs for a fully isolated test run.
# DATA_DIR=/home/somisana/ops-test
# PUBLIC_ROOT=/mnt/ocims-somisana/_test
# SAFE_ROOT=/mnt/somisana_safe/models/_test

# --- saeonapps (MERCATOR download only, D14) --------------------------------------
# COPERNICUS_USERNAME=
# COPERNICUS_PASSWORD=
